WEBVTT

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:35.220
Alice

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:39.540
You have neither the will to become Alice
nor the will to fight!

00:01:42.230 --> 00:01:45.310
If you don't even have a Rozen Maiden's
sense of duty or pride...

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:46.410
...then begone!

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:55.800
Look!

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:57.260
You too!

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:02.910
They did not wish to fight.

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:04.470
As sisters...

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:07.730
As fellow dolls,
they did not want to hate each other.

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:10.230
They did not want to hurt each other.

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:13.100
So why?

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:17.980
That's because we're 
Rozen Maidens, isn't it?

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.120
Shinku...

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:29.530
Medium...

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:32.840
They merely exist to 
be a source of power.

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:34.860
Shinku...

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:37.360
How beautiful...

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:47.650
Shinku...

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:51.790
I'm fine...

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:54.250
I can still feel a flood of power...

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:56.750
At this rate, I can still...

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:00.420
It can't be.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.330
I've been using Meg's 
power without realizing?

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:24.180
Souseiseki's pain was 
nothing compared to this.

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:35.190
Y-You...

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:38.640
Shinku...

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.430
Where is Shinku?

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:43.930
Why do you go to such lengths...

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:45.560
Where is Shinku?

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.500
Why?

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:01.290
Why did you take Souseiseki's 
Rosa Mystica?

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:03.910
Why did you join forces 
with Bara-Suishou?

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:05.440
Why?

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.440
Isn't it obvious?

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:10.240
We're Rozen Maidens, you know.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.760
Aspiring to become Alice, we fight...

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:14.420
...and those who are 
defeated become junk!

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:16.220
But you....

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:19.660
You know the pain of being hurt...
the agony of battle!

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:21.820
That's right! I do know!

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:23.770
Because you hurt me!

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:28.960
Quit fighting and make friends with you?

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:33.510
Live like we're playing house
at that insipid medium's place?

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:35.740
Enough with the jokes.

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:38.980
You think I would do such a thing?

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:42.990
I have never once lost 
my hatred for you!

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.220
Remember this.

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:47.090
I am Suigintou.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:50.500
I am the one who will 
turn you into junk!

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.070
Suigintou!

00:05:02.890 --> 00:05:05.310
The one to defeat you...

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:06.820
...is me.

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:11.550
This is the end.

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:22.970
Suigintou!

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.080
Shinku...

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:32.320
Father said...

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:37.850
...that I too have what 
it takes to become Alice.

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:41.250
That even with my body, 
I could become her.

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:43.040
So...

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:44.710
Suigintou...

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:49.500
I'm sorry, Meg...

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:55.290
Suigintou!

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:01.010
Souseiseki...

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:03.690
Drawn to Suiseiseki...

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:06.840
Suigintou...

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:13.160
This is...

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:15.330
Suigintou's medium?

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.570
With the Rosa Mysticas...

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:23.810
With the Rosa Mysticas...

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:28.880
That was why...

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:31.380
Shinku...

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:38.060
All that remains is you.

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:33.070
You...

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:36.070
It was all you.

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:38.570
It was all you.

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:40.290
If only you...

00:09:41.450 --> 00:09:43.580
If only you had not done this...

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:46.580
If only you had not done this...

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:48.080
Do not play with me!

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:50.250
Do not play with me.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:51.980
You are...

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:53.490
You are...

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:09.700
Stop!

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:17.440
That's enough, isn't it?

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:18.810
Jun...

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:22.290
You guys are sisters, aren't you?

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:23.680
You're fellow dolls, aren't you?

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:28.420
I don't know what wonderful 
thing Alice is.

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:33.220
I can't understand just
how important it is to you guys.

00:10:33.970 --> 00:10:38.340
But if she can only be born
by having all of you fight...

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:41.230
...it's absolutely wrong!

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:42.840
But...

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:44.700
She...

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:47.500
Shinku!

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:49.500
She...

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:52.780
What she did to everyone...

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:55.050
But even so...

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:58.260
If you do this, you'll 
be the same as her!

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:04.660
Father...

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:07.460
Shinku.

00:11:08.030 --> 00:11:09.070
I...

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:10.430
I...

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:13.930
...don't want you guys fighting anymore.

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:16.440
Let's just go back.

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:19.370
Let's go back home.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:23.270
Jun...

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:26.320
Shinku...

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:34.650
Jun...

00:11:35.070 --> 00:11:36.180
Shinku...

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:54.650
Shinku!

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:03.690
As I thought, you are weak.

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:18.150
Jun...

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:24.350
Shinku!

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:27.730
No! Stop it!

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:37.310
Shinku's Rosa Mystica...

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:46.050
You are victorious, Bara-Suishou.

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:47.790
Father...

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:52.520
My doll has won.

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:54.060
With this...

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:57.780
...I have become a stronger doll
than the Rozen Maidens, right?

00:12:57.780 --> 00:12:59.440
Yes, that's right.

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:04.780
I've made a stronger, more
beautiful doll than that Rozen.

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:06.910
Finally...

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:09.450
I'll fix this arm for you.

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:12.480
Than... Rozen?

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:16.280
You're not Rozen?

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:17.860
Rozen?

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:20.950
I am even greater than Rozen.

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:23.290
The greatest doll maker...

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:27.530
I have surpassed my master,
whom no one could surpass.

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:29.930
"My master"?

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:32.330
You're Rozen's apprentice?

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:34.730
Then...

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:36.570
Shinku and the others were tricked...

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:40.070
For something like this...

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:47.980
Restore them!

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:49.580
Restore Shinku and the others
to the way they were!

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:51.980
Doing something this stupid!

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:54.000
I'll never forgive you!

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:55.120
I'll make you...

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:01.880
You're just a child who happened
to become Shinku's medium.

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:03.230
Don't give me this 
high-and-mighty speech.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:06.180
I doubt you could understand.

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:08.970
Not when you're incapable of
giving birth to anything.

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:11.700
You just keep quiet there and watch.

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:15.270
The moment when the 
greatest doll is born.

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:16.590
Father...

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:20.310
Bara-Suishou, you are my doll.

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:23.470
You are my greatest masterpiece.

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:24.210
Yes.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.220
You are beautiful.

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:27.890
Father...

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:31.430
What's wrong?

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:32.590
My chest...

00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:34.410
I-It's so hot...

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:35.780
Bara-Suishou!

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:42.400
Father...

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:44.330
I...

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:50.670
Cracks! On your face!

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:52.670
Father...

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:54.760
Father...

00:14:58.600 --> 00:14:59.710
Bara-Suishou...

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:02.330
Let the Rosa Mysticas out.

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:04.590
At this rate, you will become broken!

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:06.860
Father...

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:10.360
Father...

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:12.280
Father!

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:14.200
No!

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:16.600
My precious doll!

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:18.620
Father...

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:20.100
Father...

00:15:21.640 --> 00:15:24.220
Father...

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:50.130
It seems the light of truth
was too dazzling for the lie.

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:52.080
The demon Laplace...

00:15:53.990 --> 00:15:55.370
You knew everything?

00:15:55.900 --> 00:16:00.430
The time for merry mischief is now over.

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:01.870
You call that merry?

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:05.170
I shall go adrift again.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:07.610
Until I find a new toy.

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:09.120
Toy?

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:14.250
Return to the real world 
before you are broken.

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:17.060
Boy who merely wound the spring.

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:41.160
Shinku...

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:43.680
I had no choice but to stop you.

00:16:44.410 --> 00:16:47.440
I didn't want you to fight anymore...

00:16:48.470 --> 00:16:49.290
But...

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:50.960
Those bastards...

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:52.330
Damn it...

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:58.700
Hey, Rozen!

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:01.430
You're watching this
along with that rabbit, aren't you?

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:04.330
Is this what you wanted?

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:08.570
Did you make dolls so that you
could make them do this?

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:11.570
Answer me, Rozen!

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:13.810
They all love you, you know!

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:16.910
For decades, for centuries past!

00:17:17.420 --> 00:17:21.420
They've pursued only you
and dreamed only of you!

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:24.880
Say something to them.

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:27.390
Give them some sort of answer!

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:32.310
Why won't you love them?

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:34.350
Why?

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:38.690
Damn it...

00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:40.500
I...

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:42.080
I couldn't do...

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:48.310
Father...

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:01.510
I...

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:06.560
I...

00:19:22.310 --> 00:19:23.500
Shinku.

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:25.090
Shinku.

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:28.270
Shinku.

00:19:31.550 --> 00:19:32.470
Jun.

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:33.630
Shinku.

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:42.750
Jun, I met Father.

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:47.620
Father told me...

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:51.170
That I should once again 
aspire to become Alice.

00:19:51.970 --> 00:19:57.060
But the Alice Game is not
the only way to become Alice.

00:19:57.060 --> 00:19:58.750
There are other ways.

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:02.010
I heard it too.

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:07.160
Everyone else is going to 
be restored too, right?

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:08.600
Yes.

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:11.220
The ones who were defeated 
by Bara-Suishou...

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:13.220
But...

00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:16.610
Souseiseki and Hina-Ichigo...

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:21.020
That is a burden that I 
must bear from now on.

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:25.370
That is why Father restored me.

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:28.530
He bade me resolve this matter.

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:30.130
You can do it.

00:20:30.650 --> 00:20:32.100
I'm sure you can do it.

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:49.680
Detective Kun-kun
~A Requiem for the Dolls~

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:50.700
The Great Detective Kun-kun!

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:54.330
Let us go.

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:56.970
Or Detective Kun-kun 
will start without us.
